    "title": "Download",
    "html": "<p>You can download a ready-to-use archive for your database or format below. Each archive contains the complete dataset folder of the latest release.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Archives are published for the latest release tag. Older versions remain available under their own version path on the CDN.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Dataset</th>\n<th>Format</th>\n<th>Version</th>\n<th>Size</th>\n<th>Download</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>PostgreSQL / PostGIS</td>\n<td>SQL</td>\n<td>v5.2.0</td>\n<td>41.82 MB</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://vn-provinces-ds.thanglequoc.xyz/v5.2.0/postgresql/vn_provinces_postgresql_dataset_v5.2.0.zip\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">vn_provinces_postgresql_dataset_v5.2.0.zip</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MySQL / MariaDB</td>\n<td>SQL</td>\n<td>v5.2.0</td>\n<td>40.70 MB</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://vn-provinces-ds.thanglequoc.xyz/v5.2.0/mysql/vn_provinces_mysql_dataset_v5.2.0.zip\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">vn_provinces_mysql_dataset_v5.2.0.zip</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Microsoft SQL Server</td>\n<td>SQL</td>\n<td>v5.2.0</td>\n<td>41.84 MB</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://vn-provinces-ds.thanglequoc.xyz/v5.2.0/sqlserver/vn_provinces_sqlserver_dataset_v5.2.0.zip\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">vn_provinces_sqlserver_dataset_v5.2.0.zip</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Oracle</td>\n<td>SQL</td>\n<td>v5.2.0</td>\n<td>88.43 KB</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://vn-provinces-ds.thanglequoc.xyz/v5.2.0/oracle/vn_provinces_oracle_dataset_v5.2.0.zip\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">vn_provinces_oracle_dataset_v5.2.0.zip</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>JSON</td>\n<td>JSON</td>\n<td>v5.2.0</td>\n<td>96.18 MB</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://vn-provinces-ds.thanglequoc.xyz/v5.2.0/json/vn_provinces_json_dataset_v5.2.0.zip\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">vn_provinces_json_dataset_v5.2.0.zip</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MongoDB</td>